  "instructions": [
    "Heat the olive oil in a large skillet over medium-high heat.",
    "Sauté the sliced jalapeños and garlic granules for 2 minutes until fragrant.",
    "Add the thinly sliced potatoes and cook for 5 minutes, stirring occasionally.",
    "Add the crumbled feta cheese, lemon juice, salt, and black pepper. Stir to combine.",
    "Transfer the potato mixture to a baking dish and top with the double-fried potatoes.",
    "Bake in a preheated oven at 400°F (200°C) for 15-20 minutes, or until the cheese is melted and bubbly.",
    "Garnish with chopped fresh parsley and serve hot."
